The retained nuisance terms reconverged cleanly (Rwp ≈13.05%; provisional 74.2/9.3/16.5 wt%). I’m now performing the required mature-baseline phase-inventory retest: SrO, two SrCO₃ forms, two SrO₂ forms, and monoclinic SrWO₄ are each being added one at a time with an independently refined scale, so overlap with the now-refined three-phase model cannot hide a real minor component.

