Early removal behavior is already decisive: removing Lorentzian broadening roughly doubles χ², removing Sr₃W₂O₉ texture materially worsens the fit, and leaving out SrWO₄ increases χ² by nearly an order of magnitude. I’m waiting for all matched branches so the weaker WO₃ and coordinate contributions are judged on the same basis.

